        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1340.4000000000024,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 214
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 185,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: To talk about, I mean? They'd better be germane to the material ...",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "To talk about, I mean? They'd better be germane to the material ...",
        "start_offset": 1340.8000000000025,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 215
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 186,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, I guess, uhm \u2014 do you foresee this musical being performed in a theater, that is to say, on a stage?\nI'm trying to picture it, to come up with more ideas to talk about.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, I guess, uhm \u2014 do you foresee this musical being performed in a theater, that is to say, on a stage?",
        "start_offset": 1346.0000000000025,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 216
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm trying to picture it, to come up with more ideas to talk about.",
        "start_offset": 1354.8000000000025,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 217
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 187,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I don't ... know, I guess.\nNo, not like a 'Broadway musical,' if that's what you mean.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I don't ... know, I guess.",
        "start_offset": 1360.4000000000024,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 218
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No, not like a 'Broadway musical,' if that's what you mean.",
        "start_offset": 1362.8000000000025,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 219
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 188,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Yes.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Yes.",
        "start_offset": 1367.2000000000025,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 220
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 189,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No. Then no, not like that.\nIt's a different kind of musical. More like a play with music, about the music.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No. Then no, not like that.",
        "start_offset": 1367.6000000000026,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 221
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's a different kind of musical. More like a play with music, about the music.",
        "start_offset": 1370.0000000000027,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 222
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 190,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: But no acting? Or ... gesticulating?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But no acting? Or ... gesticulating?",
        "start_offset": 1376.0000000000027,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 223
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 191,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: It's FUNNY, remember. It's a comedy.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's FUNNY, remember. It's a comedy.",
        "start_offset": 1378.4000000000028,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 224
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 192,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: But not the music.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But not the music.",
        "start_offset": 1380.800000000003,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 225
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 193,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 1382.4000000000028,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 226
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1382.800000000003,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 227
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 194,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I mean, it IS pretty funny, on occasion.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I mean, it IS pretty funny, on occasion.",
        "start_offset": 1383.200000000003,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 228
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 195,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Thanks.\nI mean, that sucks.\n[Long pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "start_offset": 1386.400000000003,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 229
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I mean, that sucks.",
        "start_offset": 1386.8000000000031,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 230
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1388.400000000003,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 231
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 196,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Did you fall asleep again?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Did you fall asleep again?",
        "start_offset": 1388.8000000000031,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 232
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 197,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: No.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 1390.8000000000031,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 233
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 198,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Oh. You didn't mean the music, though, I realized, so thanks. Right?\n[Pause]\nStill no germane ideas to discuss, huh?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Oh. You didn't mean the music, though, I realized, so thanks. Right?",
        "start_offset": 1391.2000000000032,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 234
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1396.0000000000032,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 235
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Still no germane ideas to discuss, huh?",
        "start_offset": 1396.4000000000033,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 236
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 199,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, since you don't imagine this piece being performed on a stage \u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, since you don't imagine this piece being performed on a stage \u2014",
        "start_offset": 1399.2000000000032,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 237
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 200,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Besides the once, of course.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Besides the once, of course.",
        "start_offset": 1404.4000000000033,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 238
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Pardon?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Pardon?",
        "start_offset": 1406.4000000000033,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 239
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Right, staged on a set, probably with some sort of pyrotechnic action, time permitting.\nFor the gesamtkunstwerk competition, remember? It has to be performed, and then a collectible edition of it has to be made available for sale, the whole dealbreaker.\nI can't imagine I'll film it, that's optional or anyway strictly for my own use \u2014 probably just give away this script, or maybe a studio recording of somebody, a couple of nobody soulless working schlubs like you and me, doing you and me, and they can have at it, if I have time before the deadline and travel and everything.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Right, staged on a set, probably with some sort of pyrotechnic action, time permitting.",
        "start_offset": 1406.8000000000034,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 240
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For the gesamtkunstwerk competition, remember? It has to be performed, and then a collectible edition of it has to be made available for sale, the whole dealbreaker.",
        "start_offset": 1412.4000000000033,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 241
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I can't imagine I'll film it, that's optional or anyway strictly for my own use \u2014 probably just give away this script, or maybe a studio recording of somebody, a couple of nobody soulless working schlubs like you and me, doing you and me, and they can have at it, if I have time before the deadline and travel and everything.",
        "start_offset": 1423.2000000000032,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 242
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1447.6000000000033,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 243
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: So it IS a musical, on a stage, with special effects.\nBut, if I\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "So it IS a musical, on a stage, with special effects.",
        "start_offset": 1448.0000000000034,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 244
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But, if I\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1452.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 245
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Not like a touring production, some big to-do charging five hundred bucks a pop, and that's BEFORE transportation and lodging!\nMore of an art piece \u2014 or like, the very fact that it might even be staged at all being so ridiculous is part of the intentionary design.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Not like a touring production, some big to-do charging five hundred bucks a pop, and that's BEFORE transportation and lodging!",
        "start_offset": 1453.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 246
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "More of an art piece \u2014 or like, the very fact that it might even be staged at all being so ridiculous is part of the intentionary design.",
        "start_offset": 1461.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 247
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I see.\nAnd you think this ... sort of thing will appeal to people who DON'T already like your primary anonymous artist, or who\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I see.",
        "start_offset": 1472.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 248
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "And you think this ... sort of thing will appeal to people who DON'T already like your primary anonymous artist, or who\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1473.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 249
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Intrinsic \u2014 hey, let's not worry so much about what I think, remember? Or rather, forget.\nWe know all the right pieces are there, outside of a little additional scrubbing, the debris off of it, the face, which will crud in due time. Nothing to be.\nIn due time, and the fact of it is that no, I DON'T know if it'll appeal to ANYONE.\nMaybe a few other people have had this sort of unusual relationship with an artist and their music. Perhaps even THIS one.\nI couldn't know, and can't possibly imagine due to task constraints.\nBut if there are, they'd probably hate it even MORE.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Intrinsic \u2014 hey, let's not worry so much about what I think, remember? Or rather, forget.",
        "start_offset": 1482.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 250
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "We know all the right pieces are there, outside of a little additional scrubbing, the debris off of it, the face, which will crud in due time. Nothing to be.",
        "start_offset": 1488.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 251
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "In due time, and the fact of it is that no, I DON'T know if it'll appeal to ANYONE.",
        "start_offset": 1500.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 252
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Maybe a few other people have had this sort of unusual relationship with an artist and their music. Perhaps even THIS one.",
        "start_offset": 1508.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 253
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I couldn't know, and can't possibly imagine due to task constraints.",
        "start_offset": 1517.2000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 254
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "But if there are, they'd probably hate it even MORE.",
        "start_offset": 1521.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 255
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Than who?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Than who?",
        "start_offset": 1525.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 256
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 208,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: The average jerk.\nNot that any random person you find and drag in to watch would hate it, or even necessarily be a jerk, but you have to admit \u2014 it's a risk.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "The average jerk.",
        "start_offset": 1526.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 257
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Not that any random person you find and drag in to watch would hate it, or even necessarily be a jerk, but you have to admit \u2014 it's a risk.",
        "start_offset": 1527.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 258
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 209,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: For them? Or you?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "For them? Or you?",
        "start_offset": 1539.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 259
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 210,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: For both of us. That's art, right?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For both of us. That's art, right?",
        "start_offset": 1541.2000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 260
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 211,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: It can be.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It can be.",
        "start_offset": 1544.0000000000034,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 261
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 212,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I largely assert that it has to be.\n[Pause]\nIt doesn't have to be like THIS, obviously.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I largely assert that it has to be.",
        "start_offset": 1545.2000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 262
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1548.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 263
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It doesn't have to be like THIS, obviously.",
        "start_offset": 1548.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 264
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 213,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Obviously.\n[Long pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Obviously.",
        "start_offset": 1552.0000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 265
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1552.4000000000037,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 266
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 214,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Should I be considering the possibility that this whole, well, \"sort of thing\" is a prank, at my expense? Hmm?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Should I be considering the possibility that this whole, well, \"sort of thing\" is a prank, at my expense? Hmm?",
        "start_offset": 1552.8000000000038,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 267
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 215,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You can consider just about anything imaginable, given the time.\nAnd it's a zombie comedy musical, or musical comedy, I'm just not sure yet.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You can consider just about anything imaginable, given the time.",
        "start_offset": 1560.8000000000038,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 268
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And it's a zombie comedy musical, or musical comedy, I'm just not sure yet.",
        "start_offset": 1564.8000000000038,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 269
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 216,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I suppose it wouldn't be a very good prank if you admitted to it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I suppose it wouldn't be a very good prank if you admitted to it.",
        "start_offset": 1570.4000000000037,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 270
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 217,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Yeah, but no, let's talk about it that way. Does it FEEL like a prank, to you?\nPranks can be funny.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Yeah, but no, let's talk about it that way. Does it FEEL like a prank, to you?",
        "start_offset": 1576.0000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 271
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Pranks can be funny.",
        "start_offset": 1582.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 272
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 218,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Not to the one being pranked.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Not to the one being pranked.",
        "start_offset": 1584.4000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 273
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 219,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Sometimes, some do. Some people love being pranked, it drives them nuts.\nThey can't get enough of it. They seek it out.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Sometimes, some do. Some people love being pranked, it drives them nuts.",
        "start_offset": 1586.8000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 274
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "They can't get enough of it. They seek it out.",
        "start_offset": 1591.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 275
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 220,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm not one of those people, and I've never met one.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm not one of those people, and I've never met one.",
        "start_offset": 1595.6000000000035,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 276
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 221,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I have some crazy, idiosyncratic friends. They're involved in the local alternative comedy scene. It's NUTS, they're psychotic, you wouldn't understand.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I have some crazy, idiosyncratic friends. They're involved in the local alternative comedy scene. It's NUTS, they're psychotic, you wouldn't understand.",
        "start_offset": 1600.0000000000036,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 277
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 222,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I think I have some idea.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I think I have some idea.",
        "start_offset": 1608.4000000000037,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 278
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 223,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Anyway, their experiences aren't typical. But this sounds like one of their pranks, just the type of psycho entrapment and subterfuge they love.\nMaybe they'd do it to YOU. Maybe they know who you are and have an issue with it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Anyway, their experiences aren't typical. But this sounds like one of their pranks, just the type of psycho entrapment and subterfuge they love.",
        "start_offset": 1610.8000000000038,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 279
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Maybe they'd do it to YOU. Maybe they know who you are and have an issue with it.",
        "start_offset": 1620.0000000000039,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 280
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 224,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Me? Why?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Me? Why?",
        "start_offset": 1627.200000000004,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 281
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 225,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I'm just saying, maybe they have some sort of idea about your personality, and what frightens you, and they don't like it. So they want to give you a scare.\nYou ever thought about THAT?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I'm just saying, maybe they have some sort of idea about your personality, and what frightens you, and they don't like it. So they want to give you a scare.",
        "start_offset": 1628.0000000000039,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 282
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You ever thought about THAT?",
        "start_offset": 1640.0000000000039,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 283
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 226,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I was talking about a PRANK.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I was talking about a PRANK.",
        "start_offset": 1642.0000000000039,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 284
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 227,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I know, but THINK about it. Some pranks are scary, too.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I know, but THINK about it. Some pranks are scary, too.",
        "start_offset": 1644.400000000004,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 285
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1648.800000000004,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 286
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 228,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: If it WAS a prank, I guess I would just leave?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "If it WAS a prank, I guess I would just leave?",
        "start_offset": 1649.2000000000041,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 287
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 229,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Yeah, it doesn't really work. Also, I'm traditionally extremely \u2014 it just isn't what I'm trying to do here.\nAnd I know what I want and what I'm ultimately trying to achieve and prove isn't the focus anymore, but still. Sure does seem like there has to be a limit to how much we exclude my self from this, and now we're up against it.\nBut I just can't see doing this whole musical as a scary, hilarious prank on you.\nIt's just not my nature.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Yeah, it doesn't really work. Also, I'm traditionally extremely \u2014 it just isn't what I'm trying to do here.",
        "start_offset": 1653.6000000000042,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 288
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And I know what I want and what I'm ultimately trying to achieve and prove isn't the focus anymore, but still. Sure does seem like there has to be a limit to how much we exclude my self from this, and now we're up against it.",
        "start_offset": 1661.2000000000041,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 289
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "But I just can't see doing this whole musical as a scary, hilarious prank on you.",
        "start_offset": 1679.6000000000042,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 290
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's just not my nature.",
        "start_offset": 1686.0000000000043,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 291
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 230,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, thank you. Thank you for that.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, thank you. Thank you for that.",
        "start_offset": 1688.0000000000043,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 292
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1690.8000000000043,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 293
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 231,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Telling you WOULD ruin it, though.\nYou're right about that one.\n[Long pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Telling you WOULD ruin it, though.",
        "start_offset": 1691.2000000000044,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 294
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You're right about that one.",
        "start_offset": 1693.6000000000045,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 295
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1695.6000000000045,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 296
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 232,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: What would a prank musical even BE? Let's pretend we're talking about a prank against multiple victims, not just you.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "What would a prank musical even BE? Let's pretend we're talking about a prank against multiple victims, not just you.",
        "start_offset": 1696.0000000000045,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 297
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1704.0000000000045,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 298
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 233,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, for one thing, it would have to be designed to make them uncomfortable, without any guaranteed benefit.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, for one thing, it would have to be designed to make them uncomfortable, without any guaranteed benefit.",
        "start_offset": 1704.4000000000046,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 299
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 234,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: But there's no way that'd be ENOUGH, right?\nThat's like ... well, that's like a lot of stuff that ART is. We'll leave it at that. So no. It would have to be more targeted. And like ... worse.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "But there's no way that'd be ENOUGH, right?",
        "start_offset": 1711.6000000000047,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 300
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's like ... well, that's like a lot of stuff that ART is. We'll leave it at that. So no. It would have to be more targeted. And like ... worse.",
        "start_offset": 1714.8000000000047,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 301
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 235,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: What about something along the lines of \"The 'Weird' Al 'Musical'?\"",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What about something along the lines of \"The 'Weird' Al 'Musical'?\"",
        "start_offset": 1727.2000000000048,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 302
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 236,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: That's PARODY. Totally different. Have you seen it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's PARODY. Totally different. Have you seen it?",
        "start_offset": 1731.600000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 303
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 237,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I have.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I have.",
        "start_offset": 1734.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 304
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 238,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Did you suffer?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Did you suffer?",
        "start_offset": 1735.600000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 305
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 239,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I did not.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I did not.",
        "start_offset": 1736.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 306
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 240,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Then it's not a prank.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Then it's not a prank.",
        "start_offset": 1738.000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 307
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 241,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Or at least \u2014 it has not been revealed to me that I did, or how much.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Or at least \u2014 it has not been revealed to me that I did, or how much.",
        "start_offset": 1740.000000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 308
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 242,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Yet. That's another huge factor, the revelation of the prank's mechanism, and a quantification of impact.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Yet. That's another huge factor, the revelation of the prank's mechanism, and a quantification of impact.",
        "start_offset": 1746.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 309
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 243,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: For sure. Can an unrevealed prank even be considered a prank?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "For sure. Can an unrevealed prank even be considered a prank?",
        "start_offset": 1753.200000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 310
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 244,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No. And so no \u2014 only if I revealed, to you, that this was all only to cause you suffering, could it reasonably be a prank horror musical on you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No. And so no \u2014 only if I revealed, to you, that this was all only to cause you suffering, could it reasonably be a prank horror musical on you.",
        "start_offset": 1757.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 311
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 245,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Including how much.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Including how much.",
        "start_offset": 1769.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 312
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 246,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: And we've already established that revealing that it IS a prank, while it is still in progress, spoils the prank.\nSo it isn't. One.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And we've already established that revealing that it IS a prank, while it is still in progress, spoils the prank.",
        "start_offset": 1770.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 313
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "So it isn't. One.",
        "start_offset": 1778.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 314
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 247,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Glad we could sort that out.\n[Long pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Glad we could sort that out.",
        "start_offset": 1780.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 315
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1782.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 316
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 248,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Two, it would be a really BAD prank, unless I was just randomly goofing around, instead of weirdly earnest about my actual desire to make a zombie musical, using just my artificial inspiration memories, this music, and a very particular kind of silence.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Two, it would be a really BAD prank, unless I was just randomly goofing around, instead of weirdly earnest about my actual desire to make a zombie musical, using just my artificial inspiration memories, this music, and a very particular kind of silence.",
        "start_offset": 1783.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 317
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 249,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I've been asleep again.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I've been asleep again.",
        "start_offset": 1800.4000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 318
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 250,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Three, I feel like this is uncovering some really fundamental insights about how people experience music subjectively.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Three, I feel like this is uncovering some really fundamental insights about how people experience music subjectively.",
        "start_offset": 1802.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 319
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 251,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: [Long yawn] Who is, the song? Wow, I'm STILL much more tired than I thought.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "[Long yawn] Who is, the song? Wow, I'm STILL much more tired than I thought.",
        "start_offset": 1808.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 320
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 252,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: The entire plan. And then, of course, the crucial aspect of scrubbing me off, which I think worked more or less perfectly. It really is something!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "The entire plan. And then, of course, the crucial aspect of scrubbing me off, which I think worked more or less perfectly. It really is something!",
        "start_offset": 1814.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 321
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 253,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I can't argue with that.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I can't argue with that.",
        "start_offset": 1825.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 322
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 254,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: How do we transfer what we enjoy about a delineable subset of the world's music to another person without having to evaluate their own experience of it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "How do we transfer what we enjoy about a delineable subset of the world's music to another person without having to evaluate their own experience of it?",
        "start_offset": 1827.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 323
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 255,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Don't have the energy.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Don't have the energy.",
        "start_offset": 1838.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 324
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 256,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Exactly \u2014 none of us do, much less the TIME.\nWe need to devise some sort of novel systemic method, to make things easier.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Exactly \u2014 none of us do, much less the TIME.",
        "start_offset": 1839.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 325
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "We need to devise some sort of novel systemic method, to make things easier.",
        "start_offset": 1843.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 326
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 257,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm still thrilled to not be being humiliated.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm still thrilled to not be being humiliated.",
        "start_offset": 1849.200000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 327
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 258,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Oh, absolutely not. But it's like, I don't even remember what it sounds like anymore.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Oh, absolutely not. But it's like, I don't even remember what it sounds like anymore.",
        "start_offset": 1852.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 328
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 259,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I know what you mean.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I know what you mean.",
        "start_offset": 1858.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 329
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 260,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Do you?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Do you?",
        "start_offset": 1860.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 330
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 261,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Oh, not personally.\nI know what it sounds like because we're currently listening to it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Oh, not personally.",
        "start_offset": 1861.200000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 331
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I know what it sounds like because we're currently listening to it.",
        "start_offset": 1862.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 332
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 262,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You are. Maybe. But I can barely hear it.\nFor I have listened to it so much that I have forgotten how it sounds. Or perhaps it doesn't matter.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You are. Maybe. But I can barely hear it.",
        "start_offset": 1867.200000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 333
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For I have listened to it so much that I have forgotten how it sounds. Or perhaps it doesn't matter.",
        "start_offset": 1870.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 334
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 263,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Which?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Which?",
        "start_offset": 1878.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 335
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 264,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: What it is.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "What it is.",
        "start_offset": 1879.200000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 336
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 265,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm afraid I don't quite understand.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm afraid I don't quite understand.",
        "start_offset": 1880.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 337
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 266,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: That's precisely it. You can never know what's going on in another person's head.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's precisely it. You can never know what's going on in another person's head.",
        "start_offset": 1882.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 338
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 267,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Mm-hmm.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Mm-hmm.",
        "start_offset": 1888.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 339
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 268,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Until they tell you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Until they tell you.",
        "start_offset": 1888.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 340
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 269,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Oh.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Oh.",
        "start_offset": 1890.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 341
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 270,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: And then, you have to take them at their word. BEYOND their word.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And then, you have to take them at their word. BEYOND their word.",
        "start_offset": 1890.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 342
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 271,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm curious to know m\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm curious to know m\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1896.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 343
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 272,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You don't know if they hate you, or if they're secretly fascinated by your virtual obtrusions into their digital life, your soulless and lifeless avatar sucking out precious megabytes when all they needed to do was secure or promote an upcoming gig.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You don't know if they hate you, or if they're secretly fascinated by your virtual obtrusions into their digital life, your soulless and lifeless avatar sucking out precious megabytes when all they needed to do was secure or promote an upcoming gig.",
        "start_offset": 1898.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 344
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 273,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Who is this that might hate me, again?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Who is this that might hate me, again?",
        "start_offset": 1914.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 345
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 274,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No one. Or somebody, but it's nothing to be.\nA fictional image, an archetron. Whatever it's called, they're not real.\nEspecially once they make it clear what's going on.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No one. Or somebody, but it's nothing to be.",
        "start_offset": 1918.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 346
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "A fictional image, an archetron. Whatever it's called, they're not real.",
        "start_offset": 1921.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 347
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Especially once they make it clear what's going on.",
        "start_offset": 1926.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 348
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 275,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Then you can take them at their word.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Then you can take them at their word.",
        "start_offset": 1929.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 349
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 276,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You MUST. Now that you mention it, it IS sort of like a practical joke being played on them, for revenge.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You MUST. Now that you mention it, it IS sort of like a practical joke being played on them, for revenge.",
        "start_offset": 1932.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 350
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 277,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Your use of the passive voice is suspicious.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Your use of the passive voice is suspicious.",
        "start_offset": 1941.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 351
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 278,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Do you think of me as accountable? I'm not the only one doing this.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Do you think of me as accountable? I'm not the only one doing this.",
        "start_offset": 1944.4000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 352
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 279,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm not\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm not\u2014",
        "start_offset": 1950.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 353
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 280,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I'm not talking about you.\n[Pause. Dr looks around.]\nWhat if it's a COSMIC joke?\nYou know, by the universe.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I'm not talking about you.",
        "start_offset": 1950.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 354
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1952.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 355
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "What if it's a COSMIC joke?",
        "start_offset": 1953.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 356
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You know, by the universe.",
        "start_offset": 1955.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 357
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 281,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: On ... all of us?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "On ... all of us?",
        "start_offset": 1957.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 358
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 282,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Whomever is willing to care about it.\nIsn't that the chance you always take?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Whomever is willing to care about it.",
        "start_offset": 1959.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 359
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Isn't that the chance you always take?",
        "start_offset": 1962.4000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 360
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 283,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: With jokes?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "With jokes?",
        "start_offset": 1965.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 361
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 284,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: With musicals.\n[Pause.]\nThat was a joke.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "With musicals.",
        "start_offset": 1966.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 362
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 1966.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 363
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That was a joke.",
        "start_offset": 1967.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 364
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 285,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Ah.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Ah.",
        "start_offset": 1968.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 365
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 286,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: They're not my strong suit, as I think I've illustrated. That's why it couldn't just be me.\nIt takes a lot of effort, you know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "They're not my strong suit, as I think I've illustrated. That's why it couldn't just be me.",
        "start_offset": 1969.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 366
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It takes a lot of effort, you know.",
        "start_offset": 1976.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 367
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 287,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm sure it does.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm sure it does.",
        "start_offset": 1979.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 368
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 288,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: And coordination.\nNot like roller skating or driving a box truck, mind you, but reconciling incentive streams and supply lines across different real and fictional people one has come to depend upon for services and assistance or accommodations.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And coordination.",
        "start_offset": 1980.8000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 369
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Not like roller skating or driving a box truck, mind you, but reconciling incentive streams and supply lines across different real and fictional people one has come to depend upon for services and assistance or accommodations.",
        "start_offset": 1981.6000000000051,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 370
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 289,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Fictional?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Fictional?",
        "start_offset": 1996.0000000000052,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 371
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 290,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: My bad, even the avatars are real in this scenario \u2014 or you better treat them like they are, if you want results at a fixed rate.\nThey can change the percentages on you after delivery, dynamically, is why I bring it up \u2014 you should be careful about that. I've been burned.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "My bad, even the avatars are real in this scenario \u2014 or you better treat them like they are, if you want results at a fixed rate.",
        "start_offset": 1996.4000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 372
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "They can change the percentages on you after delivery, dynamically, is why I bring it up \u2014 you should be careful about that. I've been burned.",
        "start_offset": 2007.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 373
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 291,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm well aware. Various, vicious real and fictional antagonists, everywhere you seem to turn!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm well aware. Various, vicious real and fictional antagonists, everywhere you seem to turn!",
        "start_offset": 2017.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 374
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 292,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: It's not like THAT. But still.\nIn any case, I don't BLAME the workers. They're just trying to eke out an advantage or a living or what have you. Nothing major or unforgivable.\nThat's the main difference, I guess, compared to most musicals. They're usually composed less out of revenge.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's not like THAT. But still.",
        "start_offset": 2023.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 375
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "In any case, I don't BLAME the workers. They're just trying to eke out an advantage or a living or what have you. Nothing major or unforgivable.",
        "start_offset": 2025.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 376
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's the main difference, I guess, compared to most musicals. They're usually composed less out of revenge.",
        "start_offset": 2036.4000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 377
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2043.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 378
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 293,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Less than what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Less than what?",
        "start_offset": 2043.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 379
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 294,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Than whatever. Art, music, fun, communal justices, eternal reward, getting out of the house. There are plenty of suitable reasons if you need one.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Than whatever. Art, music, fun, communal justices, eternal reward, getting out of the house. There are plenty of suitable reasons if you need one.",
        "start_offset": 2044.8000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 380
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 295,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I should be alright for now.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I should be alright for now.",
        "start_offset": 2054.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 381
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 296,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Glory ...\n[Long pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Glory ...",
        "start_offset": 2056.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 382
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2057.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 383
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 297,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Do you feel like you have what you need?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Do you feel like you have what you need?",
        "start_offset": 2058.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 384
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 298,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No.",
        "start_offset": 2061.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 385
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 299,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Will you ever?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Will you ever?",
        "start_offset": 2062.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 386
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 300,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Probably so. Most probably, yes, I will get it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Probably so. Most probably, yes, I will get it.",
        "start_offset": 2063.2000000000057,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 387
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 301,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I meant for your musical.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I meant for your musical.",
        "start_offset": 2066.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 388
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 302,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I know what you meant. I wouldn't have answered so quickly otherwise.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I know what you meant. I wouldn't have answered so quickly otherwise.",
        "start_offset": 2068.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 389
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 303,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: [Laughs] Well, now that you've had a little more time to think about it ...\nDO you? Big picture?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "[Laughs] Well, now that you've had a little more time to think about it ...",
        "start_offset": 2073.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 390
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "DO you? Big picture?",
        "start_offset": 2079.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 391
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 304,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I mean, sure. Why do you ask?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I mean, sure. Why do you ask?",
        "start_offset": 2081.2000000000057,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 392
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 305,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: For one thing, you answered pretty quickly, again.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "For one thing, you answered pretty quickly, again.",
        "start_offset": 2084.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 393
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 306,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: It's a specious question.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's a specious question.",
        "start_offset": 2087.2000000000057,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 394
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 307,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: What does that mean again?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What does that mean again?",
        "start_offset": 2088.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 395
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 308,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: It's like 'bullshit,' I think. But more clinical.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's like 'bullshit,' I think. But more clinical.",
        "start_offset": 2090.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 396
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 309,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, what a kind answer, in that case.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, what a kind answer, in that case.",
        "start_offset": 2094.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 397
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 310,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You being a jerk about it? I can be more blunt in the future. I don't HAVE to protect your feelings.\nOr provide accurate definitions, for that matter.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You being a jerk about it? I can be more blunt in the future. I don't HAVE to protect your feelings.",
        "start_offset": 2097.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 398
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Or provide accurate definitions, for that matter.",
        "start_offset": 2105.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 399
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 311,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I just thought it was a fair question. But I wouldn't argue with more straightforwardness.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I just thought it was a fair question. But I wouldn't argue with more straightforwardness.",
        "start_offset": 2108.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 400
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 312,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: That's what YOU think.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's what YOU think.",
        "start_offset": 2114.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 401
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 313,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I do.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I do.",
        "start_offset": 2116.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 402
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 314,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No, I was being a jerk about \u2014 never mind.\n[Exhales] I reckon I'm UNLIKELY to reach an end state with this musical stuff. I guess if something ever became hugely successful, on my terms, I'd think about it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No, I was being a jerk about \u2014 never mind.",
        "start_offset": 2116.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 403
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Exhales] I reckon I'm UNLIKELY to reach an end state with this musical stuff. I guess if something ever became hugely successful, on my terms, I'd think about it.",
        "start_offset": 2120.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 404
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 315,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: You'd probably think about little else.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "You'd probably think about little else.",
        "start_offset": 2132.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 405
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 316,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I meant an end state.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I meant an end state.",
        "start_offset": 2134.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 406
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 317,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: But is that likely to happen, if you continue in your ... ways?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But is that likely to happen, if you continue in your ... ways?",
        "start_offset": 2136.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 407
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 318,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Again, not my problem. It seems like YOU want me to stop.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Again, not my problem. It seems like YOU want me to stop.",
        "start_offset": 2142.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 408
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 319,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Not at all.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Not at all.",
        "start_offset": 2146.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 409
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 320,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: That would just make me want to not stop even more.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That would just make me want to not stop even more.",
        "start_offset": 2148.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 410
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 321,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I know. That's WHY.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I know. That's WHY.",
        "start_offset": 2152.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 411
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 322,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Mm-hmm. Maybe you're lying, though.\nMaybe this is all a prank on ME.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Mm-hmm. Maybe you're lying, though.",
        "start_offset": 2154.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 412
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Maybe this is all a prank on ME.",
        "start_offset": 2156.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 413
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 323,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I wouldn't know the first thing about how to do that.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I wouldn't know the first thing about how to do that.",
        "start_offset": 2159.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 414
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 324,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Is that the only thing holding you back?!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Is that the only thing holding you back?!",
        "start_offset": 2163.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 415
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 325,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: No, I ... [Laughs condescendingly]\nI'm not pranking you. Nor lying.\nYou can trust me. I want you to continue.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "No, I ... [Laughs condescendingly]",
        "start_offset": 2166.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 416
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm not pranking you. Nor lying.",
        "start_offset": 2168.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 417
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "You can trust me. I want you to continue.",
        "start_offset": 2171.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 418
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2174.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 419
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 326,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Big picture?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Big picture?",
        "start_offset": 2175.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 420
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 327,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Sure. Now and forever, to your heart's content.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Sure. Now and forever, to your heart's content.",
        "start_offset": 2176.0000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 421
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 328,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Alright.\nSo we have silence, revenge, and the anonymity narratives. But will that be enough?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Alright.",
        "start_offset": 2179.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 422
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "So we have silence, revenge, and the anonymity narratives. But will that be enough?",
        "start_offset": 2179.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 423
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 329,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Sure seems like a solid foundation. Honestly, what you've been describing is unusual enough that it seems difficult to \"fail,\" in any traditional sense.\nIs it, perhaps, not ... challenging enough?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Sure seems like a solid foundation. Honestly, what you've been describing is unusual enough that it seems difficult to \"fail,\" in any traditional sense.",
        "start_offset": 2185.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 424
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Is it, perhaps, not ... challenging enough?",
        "start_offset": 2194.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 425
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 330,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: For who?",
    "dialogue": [
