        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For who?",
        "start_offset": 2197.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 426
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 331,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, you DID say you would almost certainly be delighted with the results.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, you DID say you would almost certainly be delighted with the results.",
        "start_offset": 2198.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 427
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 332,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Did I really?\nOh, in front of my FAMILY, maybe \u2014 though I can't imagine I used that word. Even so, I might still hate it inside.\nI have a VERY high bar. I just don't allow it to prevent me from DISTRIBUTING stuff.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Did I really?",
        "start_offset": 2203.6000000000054,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 428
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Oh, in front of my FAMILY, maybe \u2014 though I can't imagine I used that word. Even so, I might still hate it inside.",
        "start_offset": 2204.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 429
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I have a VERY high bar. I just don't allow it to prevent me from DISTRIBUTING stuff.",
        "start_offset": 2214.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 430
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 333,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: That DOES sound challenging.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "That DOES sound challenging.",
        "start_offset": 2221.2000000000053,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 431
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 334,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You have no idea.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You have no idea.",
        "start_offset": 2222.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 432
      },
