        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2224.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 433
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 335,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I'm beginning to feel like I need to check out some of these ... primary materials, see for myself.\nTo be clear, I'm not excited about any \"recommendations\" you've made.\nFrankly, at this point ... never mind, but I'm considering it academic research, to determine how close you are to the targets of your imitation. Or not.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm beginning to feel like I need to check out some of these ... primary materials, see for myself.",
        "start_offset": 2224.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 434
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "To be clear, I'm not excited about any \"recommendations\" you've made.",
        "start_offset": 2232.400000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 435
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Frankly, at this point ... never mind, but I'm considering it academic research, to determine how close you are to the targets of your imitation. Or not.",
        "start_offset": 2236.800000000005,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 436
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 336,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Makes sense.",
    "dialogue": [
