  {
    "id": 341,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: [Anxious] Well, I'm not looking to be cured of anything, so that's out. Validation?\nResolutely \u2014 but not a PR firm to tell me how great I think I am. I mean, I DO still have to, but I don't anticipate finding that here. So what, then?\nBesides a foil, of course, a passive observer who also does the other part.\nI hope it's true that I worded my content decree appropriately enough to be cleanly enforceable, as well as captured a complicit affirmation, without giving anything away.\nOr too much, worst case. But mainly, this whole sort of thing morphing into a prank because of how LITTLE I gave away, THAT would be the absolute worst case, I suppose.\nI suppose, I wonder \u2014 when you really get presuppository about it, once you get the idea in your mind it's difficult to do anything before you figure out how much, or little, agency it's okay to retain, without the audience suddenly becoming pranked. And determining THAT is harder than nothing! Trust me, I looked it up.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Anxious] Well, I'm not looking to be cured of anything, so that's out. Validation?",
        "start_offset": 2268.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 448
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Resolutely \u2014 but not a PR firm to tell me how great I think I am. I mean, I DO still have to, but I don't anticipate finding that here. So what, then?",
        "start_offset": 2273.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 449
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Besides a foil, of course, a passive observer who also does the other part.",
        "start_offset": 2286.8000000000056,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 450
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I hope it's true that I worded my content decree appropriately enough to be cleanly enforceable, as well as captured a complicit affirmation, without giving anything away.",
        "start_offset": 2292.4000000000055,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 451
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Or too much, worst case. But mainly, this whole sort of thing morphing into a prank because of how LITTLE I gave away, THAT would be the absolute worst case, I suppose.",
        "start_offset": 2303.2000000000057,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 452
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I suppose, I wonder \u2014 when you really get presuppository about it, once you get the idea in your mind it's difficult to do anything before you figure out how much, or little, agency it's okay to retain, without the audience suddenly becoming pranked. And determining THAT is harder than nothing! Trust me, I looked it up.",
        "start_offset": 2316.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 453
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 342,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "Or the mere opportunity, perchance, for an interlocutor to say, 'Hey, you experienced so and so's piece, right? The gesamtkunstwerk?'\nAnd you to think back, and then them to go, 'Yeah you did, and that was a JOKE, on YOU. You've been PRANKED.' And laugh \u2014 or worse, rub on a shoulder.\nIt would be unthinkable. Except it's become irresponsible to NOT think about, as I'm the only one. Only out of, what, however many hundreds it took, own to me.\nOnly to, I suppose, one, given the power to put out the line of sight, the mind, of \u2014 eye power of the mind. It's impossible.\nThey're incredible, these my\u2014\n[Dr returns, briskly, with an angry tone and a head full of different hair]",
    "dialogue": []
  },
  {
    "id": 343,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Gimme a break.\n[Exhales subtly; trying to be nice again]\nWhat is?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Gimme a break.",
        "start_offset": 2338.800000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 460
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2340.000000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 461
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What is?",
        "start_offset": 2340.400000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 462
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 344,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: [Guiltily points at own head] Power to mine.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Guiltily points at own head] Power to mine.",
        "start_offset": 2341.200000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 463
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 345,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: You know what? I don't care. I mean, I'm sorry. I'm \u2014 how tough you want it to be? Or like, polite? I feel like we need to level set, except you already look kind of sad.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "You know what? I don't care. I mean, I'm sorry. I'm \u2014 how tough you want it to be? Or like, polite? I feel like we need to level set, except you already look kind of sad.",
        "start_offset": 2344.400000000006,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 464
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 346,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Not the same thing. But no, I love cruel feedback. It's a gift.\nProbably my WORST gift, if I'm being interviewed.\nYou found it, I presume?",
    "dialogue": [
