        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "start_offset": 2375.600000000006,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 469
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 349,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Afraid to be nothing. Some, I liked. A few, I may learn to love. A healthy majority are absolutely terrible.\nBut there's a common thread running throughout.",
