    "content": "DOC: It's not altogether bad, but it mostly sounds like, at best, a half-hearted parody of some of the primary artist's albums. Or styles, or sort of all of them.\nBut it's not enough. Not funny OR accurate enough. To WORK.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It's not altogether bad, but it mostly sounds like, at best, a half-hearted parody of some of the primary artist's albums. Or styles, or sort of all of them.",
