      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "'Zero,' huh. It's not going to work?",
        "start_offset": 2442.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 490
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 363,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I s'pose ... I didn't say that. And I'm not gonna start now.\nThe project \u2014 as you described it, and assuming I understand, which, never mind \u2014 could still be a success, by some standards. Particularly yours.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I s'pose ... I didn't say that. And I'm not gonna start now.",
        "start_offset": 2444.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 491
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "The project \u2014 as you described it, and assuming I understand, which, never mind \u2014 could still be a success, by some standards. Particularly yours.",
        "start_offset": 2450.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 492
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 364,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Well thank God. You had me worried!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Well thank God. You had me worried!",
        "start_offset": 2460.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 493
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 365,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: That makes two of us.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "That makes two of us.",
        "start_offset": 2462.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 494
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 366,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: But it's still nothing two.\n[A soft muffled laugh in the distance]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "But it's still nothing two.",
        "start_offset": 2464.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 495
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2466.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 496
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 367,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Not the same thing.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Not the same thing.",
        "start_offset": 2467.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 497
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2468.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 498
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 368,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: So what is it?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "So what is it?",
        "start_offset": 2469.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 499
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 369,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I guess that's always your decision to make.\nI'm just reacting to everything you're ... offering up. I can't land this bad boy.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I guess that's always your decision to make.",
        "start_offset": 2470.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 500
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm just reacting to everything you're ... offering up. I can't land this bad boy.",
        "start_offset": 2474.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 501
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 370,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I suppose you can't.\n[Pause]\nNo, definitely not. You hate it!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I suppose you can't.",
        "start_offset": 2480.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 502
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2481.6000000000063,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 503
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No, definitely not. You hate it!",
        "start_offset": 2482.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 504
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 371,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I didn't say \u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I didn't say \u2014",
        "start_offset": 2484.4000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 505
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 372,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: All this shit. All this fucking bullshit, you swear!\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "All this shit. All this fucking bullshit, you swear!",
        "start_offset": 2486.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 506
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2489.6000000000063,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 507
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 373,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: It really is fine.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It really is fine.",
        "start_offset": 2490.0000000000064,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 508
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 374,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: The music? Or me, just now, acting out like a petulant diva?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "The music? Or me, just now, acting out like a petulant diva?",
        "start_offset": 2491.6000000000063,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 509
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 375,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: You really want me to answer that?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "You really want me to answer that?",
        "start_offset": 2496.4000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 510
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 376,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I've always been curious.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I've always been curious.",
        "start_offset": 2499.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 511
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2500.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 512
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 377,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I meant ... whatever you want to do. About this, with your time, for your loved ones.\nIt's fine. Life is short, art is good. You don't need to justify it, or yourself, to yourself or me or anyone, or otherwise prove that it's all worth it somehow.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I meant ... whatever you want to do. About this, with your time, for your loved ones.",
        "start_offset": 2501.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 513
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It's fine. Life is short, art is good. You don't need to justify it, or yourself, to yourself or me or anyone, or otherwise prove that it's all worth it somehow.",
        "start_offset": 2508.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 514
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 378,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I know.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I know.",
        "start_offset": 2520.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 515
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 379,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Whatever that means.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Whatever that means.",
        "start_offset": 2521.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 516
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 380,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: [Irritated again] It means 'I know.'",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Irritated again] It means 'I know.'",
        "start_offset": 2522.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 517
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 381,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: No, \"worth it.\"",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "No, \"worth it.\"",
        "start_offset": 2524.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 518
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 382,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: 'I know' what that means too, 'somehow.'",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "'I know' what that means too, 'somehow.'",
        "start_offset": 2526.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 519
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 383,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: And what does it mean? To you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "And what does it mean? To you.",
        "start_offset": 2528.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 520
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 384,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No. In general.\nWhat it means to me is immaterial. I'm gone. Fully integrated and totally silent.\nJust words on the page and a sound of wind in the background.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No. In general.",
        "start_offset": 2531.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 521
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "What it means to me is immaterial. I'm gone. Fully integrated and totally silent.",
        "start_offset": 2532.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 522
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Just words on the page and a sound of wind in the background.",
        "start_offset": 2538.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 523
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2543.6000000000067,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 524
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 385,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I mean, I'm still interested to hear.\nI'm still listening.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I mean, I'm still interested to hear.",
        "start_offset": 2544.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 525
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I'm still listening.",
        "start_offset": 2546.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 526
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 386,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I bet you are. I bet you relish every note and hi-hat and chord change. Even though there aren't many of those.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I bet you are. I bet you relish every note and hi-hat and chord change. Even though there aren't many of those.",
        "start_offset": 2548.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 527
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 387,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Or at least AS many, yeah. It likes to do what it does, that's for certain. You nailed it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Or at least AS many, yeah. It likes to do what it does, that's for certain. You nailed it.",
        "start_offset": 2556.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 528
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 388,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I'm sure it sounds nice.\nAnyway, what 'worth it' means, to everyone, is whether or not the effort you put in in expectation of a result you got or didn't get can easily be explained to someone who is familiar with but does not like your work.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I'm sure it sounds nice.",
        "start_offset": 2564.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 529
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Anyway, what 'worth it' means, to everyone, is whether or not the effort you put in in expectation of a result you got or didn't get can easily be explained to someone who is familiar with but does not like your work.",
        "start_offset": 2566.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 530
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 389,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Uh-oh.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Uh-oh.",
        "start_offset": 2583.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 531
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 390,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: What. You think this is difficult? It's uncomfortably easy for me.\nApologies if\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "What. You think this is difficult? It's uncomfortably easy for me.",
        "start_offset": 2583.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 532
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Apologies if\u2014",
        "start_offset": 2588.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 533
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 391,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: And obviously, I like your work. I'm just not sure\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "And obviously, I like your work. I'm just not sure\u2014",
        "start_offset": 2588.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 534
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 392,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: You do?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You do?",
        "start_offset": 2592.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 535
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 393,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Totally!",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Totally!",
        "start_offset": 2593.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 536
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 394,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Well, thank you.\n[Pause]\nThanks. What's your favorite\u2014",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Well, thank you.",
        "start_offset": 2594.0000000000077,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 537
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2595.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 538
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Thanks. What's your favorite\u2014",
        "start_offset": 2595.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 539
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 395,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: But I had no idea who you are.\n[Pause]\nStill don't! Like I said, though, this is fine.\n[Points at music]\nThis is NICE! [Bobs fingers and snaps head]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But I had no idea who you are.",
        "start_offset": 2597.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 540
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2600.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 541
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Still don't! Like I said, though, this is fine.",
        "start_offset": 2600.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 542
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2604.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 543
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "This is NICE! [Bobs fingers and snaps head]",
        "start_offset": 2604.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 544
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 396,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Uh, yeah. I certainly love it, of course.\n[Pause]\nSo are you on board with my definition, then?\nFor 'worth it.'",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Uh, yeah. I certainly love it, of course.",
        "start_offset": 2608.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 545
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2611.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 546
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "So are you on board with my definition, then?",
        "start_offset": 2611.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 547
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For 'worth it.'",
        "start_offset": 2615.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 548
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 397,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: My whole point was that I don't even need one.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "My whole point was that I don't even need one.",
        "start_offset": 2616.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 549
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 398,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Oh.\n[Pause]\nYeah, I wasn't sure what I needed either. Out of this. Points, exposure, reinforcements.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Oh.",
        "start_offset": 2620.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 550
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2620.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 551
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Yeah, I wasn't sure what I needed either. Out of this. Points, exposure, reinforcements.",
        "start_offset": 2621.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 552
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 399,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: But you got it.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But you got it.",
        "start_offset": 2626.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 553
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 400,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I do?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I do?",
        "start_offset": 2628.400000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 554
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 401,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I think you did. And that has to count for something.\nEverything, even \u2014 presuming you're fully off, like you debride.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I think you did. And that has to count for something.",
        "start_offset": 2629.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 555
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Everything, even \u2014 presuming you're fully off, like you debride.",
        "start_offset": 2633.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 556
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 402,
