      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What's that?",
        "start_offset": 2655.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 570
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 412,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: It's a sort of ra\u00efsed platform, where they give out awards at ceremonies.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's a sort of ra\u00efsed platform, where they give out awards at ceremonies.",
        "start_offset": 2656.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 571
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 413,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Oh, right, duh.\n[Pause]\nSo there'll be awards and everything?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Oh, right, duh.",
        "start_offset": 2661.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 572
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2662.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 573
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "So there'll be awards and everything?",
        "start_offset": 2663.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 574
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 414,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Not for this. Not for me.\nThat's never been the goal.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Not for this. Not for me.",
        "start_offset": 2665.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 575
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "That's never been the goal.",
        "start_offset": 2668.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 576
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 415,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Why are you up there?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Why are you up there?",
        "start_offset": 2670.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 577
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 416,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Pardon?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Pardon?",
        "start_offset": 2672.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 578
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 417,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: On the da\u00efs. Thanking me.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "On the da\u00efs. Thanking me.",
        "start_offset": 2672.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 579
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 418,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: For all you've given. Dedication. With love.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For all you've given. Dedication. With love.",
        "start_offset": 2674.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 580
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 419,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Oh ... [Confused] Glad to have ... helped out.\n[Pause]\nAnd, um, be on my merry way? Unless there's anything else ...",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Oh ... [Confused] Glad to have ... helped out.",
        "start_offset": 2677.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 581
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2680.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 582
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "And, um, be on my merry way? Unless there's anything else ...",
        "start_offset": 2681.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 583
      }
