        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2697.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 593
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 427,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: I can't do that.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "I can't do that.",
        "start_offset": 2698.0000000000077,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 594
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 428,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I KNEW it!\nBecause it would ruin it, right?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I KNEW it!",
        "start_offset": 2699.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 595
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Because it would ruin it, right?",
        "start_offset": 2700.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 596
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 429,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: No, because of \u2014 as we already established, the reveal is NECESSARY.\nBut this isn't one.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "No, because of \u2014 as we already established, the reveal is NECESSARY.",
        "start_offset": 2703.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 597
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But this isn't one.",
        "start_offset": 2708.0000000000077,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 598
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 430,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: An exposure? I can't recall what we've discussed.\nOr didn't. But I don't believe you.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "An exposure? I can't recall what we've discussed.",
        "start_offset": 2709.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 599
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Or didn't. But I don't believe you.",
        "start_offset": 2712.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 600
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 431,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, that's fine, but your recollection and beliefs are incorrect. What's \"an exposure?\"\nWhat would my angle even BE?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, that's fine, but your recollection and beliefs are incorrect. What's \"an exposure?\"",
        "start_offset": 2715.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 601
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What would my angle even BE?",
        "start_offset": 2720.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 602
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 432,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I don't know. Make me feel like shit.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I don't know. Make me feel like shit.",
        "start_offset": 2723.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 603
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 433,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Because of what?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Because of what?",
        "start_offset": 2726.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 604
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 434,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: [Gestures at music] My life's work.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Gestures at music] My life's work.",
        "start_offset": 2727.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 605
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 435,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: How? By magically making you be yourself and do the things you're determined to do?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "How? By magically making you be yourself and do the things you're determined to do?",
        "start_offset": 2730.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 606
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 436,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: [Shrugs] Sure.\nOr enabling it.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "[Shrugs] Sure.",
        "start_offset": 2736.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 607
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Or enabling it.",
        "start_offset": 2736.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 608
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2738.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 609
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 437,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: It would be a hell of a prank.\n[Pause]\nBut c'mon.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It would be a hell of a prank.",
        "start_offset": 2738.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 610
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2741.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 611
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But c'mon.",
        "start_offset": 2742.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 612
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 438,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: YOU c'mon. I don't feel comfortable with this.\nI was feeling great, really secure.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "YOU c'mon. I don't feel comfortable with this.",
        "start_offset": 2742.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 613
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I was feeling great, really secure.",
        "start_offset": 2746.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 614
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 439,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Yeah.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "start_offset": 2748.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 615
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 440,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: And now I'm not sure.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And now I'm not sure.",
        "start_offset": 2748.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 616
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 441,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: It's NOT a prank. In either direction.\nBy you, on you.\nIn every way.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "It's NOT a prank. In either direction.",
        "start_offset": 2750.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 617
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "By you, on you.",
        "start_offset": 2753.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 618
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "In every way.",
        "start_offset": 2755.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 619
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2756.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 620
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 442,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I guess we'll see.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I guess we'll see.",
        "start_offset": 2756.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 621
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 443,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: At the revelation of our suffering?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "At the revelation of our suffering?",
        "start_offset": 2758.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 622
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 444,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: If it's any good.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "If it's any good.",
        "start_offset": 2760.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 623
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2762.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 624
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 445,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Or hear.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Or hear.",
        "start_offset": 2762.8000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 625
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 446,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: I appreciate the wisecrack, but it's unlikely we'll hear anything back from the audience. Even if it's fantastic, or awful.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I appreciate the wisecrack, but it's unlikely we'll hear anything back from the audience. Even if it's fantastic, or awful.",
        "start_offset": 2763.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 626
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 447,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Darn it! Why's that?\nOh, must be part of the competition guidelines.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Darn it! Why's that?",
        "start_offset": 2771.6000000000076,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 627
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Oh, must be part of the competition guidelines.",
        "start_offset": 2773.2000000000075,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 628
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 448,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: No, it's not about the festival, or anybody else.\nIt just doesn't usually work like that. For me.\nFor anyone, really, but I can only speak from personal experience.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No, it's not about the festival, or anybody else.",
        "start_offset": 2776.4000000000074,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 629
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It just doesn't usually work like that. For me.",
        "start_offset": 2780.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 630
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "For anyone, really, but I can only speak from personal experience.",
        "start_offset": 2783.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 631
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 449,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Obviously. Well, then I guess we WILL ... see.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Obviously. Well, then I guess we WILL ... see.",
        "start_offset": 2788.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 632
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 450,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Clear as day.\n[Pause]\nA symbol of what needs to be done and it's coming.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Clear as day.",
        "start_offset": 2791.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 633
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2792.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 634
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "A symbol of what needs to be done and it's coming.",
        "start_offset": 2793.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 635
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 451,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: How's that now?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "How's that now?",
        "start_offset": 2797.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 636
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 452,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: A signal. As unavoidable as an iconic brandmark.\nYou know it even when you don't see it. Even if you can't.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "A signal. As unavoidable as an iconic brandmark.",
        "start_offset": 2798.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 637
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "You know it even when you don't see it. Even if you can't.",
        "start_offset": 2802.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 638
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 453,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Did I miss something?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Did I miss something?",
        "start_offset": 2807.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 639
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 454,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Hidden in plain sight. Phony plants and hollow hardcovers.\nTradecraft, they call it, which makes it sound like a children's fair at the convention hotel.\nNo, this is something else.\nBut you know that. Because you know what it is.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Hidden in plain sight. Phony plants and hollow hardcovers.",
        "start_offset": 2808.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 640
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "Tradecraft, they call it, which makes it sound like a children's fair at the convention hotel.",
        "start_offset": 2812.4000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 641
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "No, this is something else.",
        "start_offset": 2818.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 642
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "But you know that. Because you know what it is.",
        "start_offset": 2820.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 643
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2824.8000000000065,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 644
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 455,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: You're still talking to me, right?\n[Pause. Dr leans closer and whisper-screams directly at P.]\nIn normal everyday language, you hear, not those damn human computer codes you love so God blasted much, so help me Christ? Such and such and God forsake it I will. Fuck you.\n[Pause]\nBut if not, I'm listening.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "You're still talking to me, right?",
        "start_offset": 2825.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 645
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2827.6000000000067,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 646
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "In normal everyday language, you hear, not those damn human computer codes you love so God blasted much, so help me Christ? Such and such and God forsake it I will. Fuck you.",
        "start_offset": 2828.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 647
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2841.2000000000066,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 648
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "But if not, I'm listening.",
        "start_offset": 2841.6000000000067,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 649
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 456,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: As always. And always as now, and then concurrently and forever.\nIt's something I'll come to depend on you for, despite my resistance. It all appears ... inevitable.\nI can see it now, clearly. No need to wait.\n[Pause]\nI can see it all.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "As always. And always as now, and then concurrently and forever.",
        "start_offset": 2843.6000000000067,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 650
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "It's something I'll come to depend on you for, despite my resistance. It all appears ... inevitable.",
        "start_offset": 2848.000000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 651
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I can see it now, clearly. No need to wait.",
        "start_offset": 2854.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 652
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2858.800000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 653
      },
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "I can see it all.",
        "start_offset": 2859.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 654
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 457,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: Well, then ... long as everything's, you know, all ... RIGHT, with you, well \u2014 I guess that's wonderful to hear.\nReally something! Just like you said.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Well, then ... long as everything's, you know, all ... RIGHT, with you, well \u2014 I guess that's wonderful to hear.",
        "start_offset": 2861.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 655
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "Really something! Just like you said.",
        "start_offset": 2869.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 656
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 458,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: And just what you'd feared. But not anymore.",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "PAT",
        "text": "And just what you'd feared. But not anymore.",
        "start_offset": 2872.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "PAT",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 657
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 459,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "DOC: That's right! Or rather, I'd forgotten.\n[A muffled scream in the distance]\nWhat was that, again?",
    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "That's right! Or rather, I'd forgotten.",
        "start_offset": 2875.200000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 658
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "...",
        "start_offset": 2877.600000000007,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 659
      },
      {
        "character": "DOC",
        "text": "What was that, again?",
        "start_offset": 2878.0000000000073,
        "visual_focus": "DOC",
        "action": "Speaking",
        "page_index": 660
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": 460,
    "duration_sec": 33.36363636363637,
    "content": "PAT: Nothing, too.\n[The music stops]\nBe afraid.\n[Pause]",
    "dialogue": [
